OL,3,AFrom #250 job to #9,000 bill: Inside   
OL,4,Athe rogue trader networks scamming     
OL,5,Acustomers at scale                     
OL,7,FOrganised networks of rogue plumbers   
OL,8,Fand electricians have been scamming    
OL,9,Fpeople on a large scale, a BBC         
OL,10,Finvestigation has found.               
OL,12,FNessar Khawaja, who used the online    
OL,13,Fname ThatGuyNess, regularly posted     
OL,14,FTikTok videos showing his work as a    
OL,15,Fplumber, explaining how he made        
OL,16,Fthousands of pounds from "desperate"   
OL,17,Fcustomers, and recruiting online to    
OL,18,Fexpand his network.                    
OL,20,F"Me and my team, we're top of the food 
OL,21,Fchain," he said in one video.          
